# Modelica - an object-oriented language for modeling of cyber-physical systems
# https://modelica.org/
# Ignore temporary files, build results, simulation files

## Modelica-specific files
# *~ matches any file ending in ~ (editor backup/swap files, e.g. model.mo~).
# *.bak matches general backup files (e.g. model.bak).
# *.bak-mo is a Modelica-specific backup extension (e.g. model.bak-mo).
# These patterns are case-sensitive on Linux/macOS (core.ignorecase=false);
# on Windows (core.ignorecase=true) MODEL.BAK would also be matched.
# Paths containing spaces are supported: "my model.bak" is correctly ignored.
*~
*.bak
*.bak-mo
*.mof
\#*\#
*.moe
*.mol

## Build artefacts
*.exe
*.exp
*.o
*.pyc

## Simulation files
*.mat

## Package files
*.gz
*.rar
*.tar
*.zip

## Dymola-specific files
buildlog.txt
dsfinal.txt
dsin.txt
dslog.txt
dsmodel*
dsres.txt
dymosim*
request
stat
status
stop
success
*.
